# What portalr's test application's image is built from, out of lattice's root: the workspace's
# manifests, which `uv sync --locked` checks the lock against, and the packages it installs, with
# the README and LICENSE their metadata names, portalr's built UIs among its sources.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!examples/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/portalr/README.md
!packages/portalr/LICENSE
!packages/portalr/src/
!packages/portalr/tests/__init__.py
!packages/portalr/tests/app/
!packages/grantr/README.md
!packages/grantr/LICENSE
!packages/grantr/src/
**/__pycache__
